{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":7,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"七年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1) $5\\sqrt2cm$ (2)不能","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5ed76779a47b5ff800318135","queId":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","schCode":"0000","textbookId":"5ed740d9004931cec743eee5"}],"question":"如图，用两个边长为5cm的小正方形拼成一个大的正方形．<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba07540d008o.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba076730008p.png\">","solution":"(1)大正方形的边长是<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba0799ef008d.png\">＝5<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba0799f3008p.png\">（cm）；(2)设长方形纸片的长为4xcm，宽为3xcm，则4x•3x＝48，解得：x＝±<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba0799fd008q.png\">cm＝±2（cm），据题意得，x取正值，则x＝2cm，则4x＝8cm＞5<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/17fba079a20008e.png\">cm，所以沿此大正方形边的方向剪出一个长方形，不能使剪出的长方形纸片的长宽之比为4：3，且面积为48cm<sup>2</sup>．","subQueNum":2,"subQues":[{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"VC1B658lWYrJZl52GPw","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","question":"求大正方形的边长；","sortIndex":1},{"blankCount":1,"exerciseType":"writeout","id":"JEipCeZenfzXSvDttYx","objectiveFlag":0,"optCount":4,"queId":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","question":"若沿此大正方形边长的方向剪出一个长方形，能否使剪出的长方形纸片的长宽之比为4：3，且面积为48cm<sup>2</sup>？","sortIndex":2}],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"60b74eb03462e928045019ef","knowName":"平方根与立方根的实际应用","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","sortIndex":83,"subQueId":"JEipCeZenfzXSvDttYx"},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"60b74eb03462e928045019ef","knowName":"平方根与立方根的实际应用","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"06hTkkh595krxgnSI5b","sortIndex":